# Project Analysis

## Detected Technologies
- React Native
- Expo
- Expo Router
- NativeWind
- TypeScript

## Project Structure
- android/
- app/
- assets/
- clients/
- components/
- config/
- constants/
- context/
- enums/
- hooks/
- i18n/
- ios/
